# llama-eval-callback activation dumps (regenerate: scripts/capture_oracle.sh).
# Bare `reference` (no trailing slash) so the per-worktree symlink to the main
# checkout's copy is ignored too: with `reference/` git only matches a real
# directory, which left every worktree with an untracked `reference` entry.
reference
